# Scoped to this directory only, so it cannot affect anything else in the repo.
#
# The determinism proof compares generated reports byte-for-byte against the
# checked-in goldens in tests/golden/. Git's autocrlf would rewrite those
# goldens to CRLF on checkout under Windows while the audit writes LF, so the
# comparison would fail for anyone who cloned on Windows. Forcing LF keeps the
# goldens byte-identical on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
